{"seq":1,"slug":"lock-free-data-structures","title":"无锁数据结构实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-systems-programming/practice/lock-free-data-structures","wordCount":720,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"无锁数据结构实现\">无锁数据结构实现</h1><p>无锁（lock-free）数据结构通过原子操作而非互斥锁实现线程安全的并发访问。在系统编程中——尤其是中断处理、实时系统和高并发服务器——锁的不可预测延迟是不可接受的。Rust 的类型系统为无锁编程提供了独特优势：原子操作的内存序（memory ordering）通过类型参数显式表达，数据竞争在编译期被阻止。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>无锁编程的基石是 CAS（Compare-And-Swap）操作：原子地比较一个内存位置的值，如果匹配则替换为新值。所有无锁数据结构都建立在 CAS 循环之上。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[读取当前值 current] --&gt; B{CAS: current == expected?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[写入新值, 返回成功]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D[返回实际值]&#10;    D --&gt; E[用实际值重新计算]&#10;    E --&gt; A&#10;    F[内存序] --&gt; G[Relaxed: 仅原子性]&#10;    F --&gt; H[Acquire: 读屏障]&#10;    F --&gt; I[Release: 写屏障]&#10;    F --&gt; J[AcqRel: 双向屏障]&#10;    F --&gt; K[SeqCst: 全序]\">graph TD\n    A[读取当前值 current] --&gt; B{CAS: current == expected?}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[写入新值, 返回成功]\n    B --&gt;|否| D[返回实际值]\n    D --&gt; E[用实际值重新计算]\n    E --&gt; A\n    F[内存序] --&gt; G[Relaxed: 仅原子性]\n    F --&gt; H[Acquire: 读屏障]\n    F --&gt; I[Release: 写屏障]\n    F --&gt; J[AcqRel: 双向屏障]\n    F --&gt; K[SeqCst: 全序]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>内存序</th>\n<th>保证</th>\n<th>性能开销</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>Relaxed</code></td>\n<td>仅原子性，无顺序保证</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>统计计数器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Acquire</code></td>\n<td>此操作后的读写不会重排到此操作之前</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>读取共享数据前</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Release</code></td>\n<td>此操作前的读写不会重排到此操作之后</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>写入共享数据后</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>AcqRel</code></td>\n<td>Acquire + Release</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>CAS 操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>SeqCst</code></td>\n<td>所有线程看到相同的操作顺序</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>需要全局一致时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"无锁栈-treiber-stack\">无锁栈（Treiber Stack）</h2><p>Treiber Stack 是最经典的无锁数据结构——通过 CAS 操作原子地修改栈顶指针实现 push 和 pop。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use std::sync::atomic::{AtomicPtr, Ordering};&#10;use std::ptr;&#10;&#10;struct Node&lt;T&gt; {&#10;    data: T,&#10;    next: *mut Node&lt;T&gt;,&#10;}&#10;&#10;pub struct LockFreeStack&lt;T&gt; {&#10;    head: AtomicPtr&lt;Node&lt;T&gt;&gt;,&#10;}&#10;&#10;unsafe impl&lt;T: Send&gt; Send for LockFreeStack&lt;T&gt; {}&#10;unsafe impl&lt;T: Send&gt; Sync for LockFreeStack&lt;T&gt; {}&#10;&#10;impl&lt;T&gt; LockFreeStack&lt;T&gt; {&#10;    pub fn new() -&gt; Self {&#10;        Self { head: AtomicPtr::new(ptr::null_mut()) }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    pub fn push(&amp;self, data: T) {&#10;        let new_node = Box::into_raw(Box::new(Node {&#10;            data,&#10;            next: ptr::null_mut(),&#10;        }));&#10;&#10;        loop {&#10;            let current_head = self.head.load(Ordering::Relaxed);&#10;            unsafe { (*new_node).next = current_head; }&#10;&#10;            // CAS: 如果 head 仍然是 current_head，则替换为 new_node&#10;            if self.head.compare_exchange_weak(&#10;                current_head,&#10;                new_node,&#10;                Ordering::Release,  // 发布新节点的写入&#10;                Ordering::Relaxed,&#10;            ).is_ok() {&#10;                break;&#10;            }&#10;            // 失败则重试——其他线程修改了 head&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    pub fn pop(&amp;self) -&gt; Option&lt;T&gt; {&#10;        loop {&#10;            let current_head = self.head.load(Ordering::Acquire);&#10;            if current_head.is_null() {&#10;                return None;&#10;            }&#10;&#10;            let next = unsafe { (*current_head).next };&#10;&#10;            if self.head.compare_exchange_weak(&#10;                current_head,&#10;                next,&#10;                Ordering::AcqRel,&#10;                Ordering::Acquire,&#10;            ).is_ok() {&#10;                let data = unsafe { Box::from_raw(current_head).data };&#10;                return Some(data);&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;impl&lt;T&gt; Drop for LockFreeStack&lt;T&gt; {&#10;    fn drop(&amp;mut self) {&#10;        while self.pop().is_some() {}&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use std::sync::atomic::{AtomicPtr, Ordering};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use std::ptr;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct Node&#x3C;T> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data: T,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    next: *mut Node&#x3C;T>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub struct LockFreeStack&#x3C;T> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    head: AtomicPtr&#x3C;Node&#x3C;T>>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>unsafe impl&#x3C;T: Send> Send for LockFreeStack&#x3C;T> {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>unsafe impl&#x3C;T: Send> Sync for LockFreeStack&#x3C;T> {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl&#x3C;T> LockFreeStack&#x3C;T> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub fn new() -> Self {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Self { head: AtomicPtr::new(ptr::null_mut()) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub fn push(&#x26;self, data: T) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let new_node = Box::into_raw(Box::new(Node {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            data,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            next: ptr::null_mut(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        loop {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            let current_head = self.head.load(Ordering::Relaxed);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            unsafe { (*new_node).next = current_head; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            // CAS: 如果 head 仍然是 current_head，则替换为 new_node</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            if self.head.compare_exchange_weak(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                current_head,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                new_node,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                Ordering::Release,  // 发布新节点的写入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                Ordering::Relaxed,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ).is_ok() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                break;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            // 失败则重试——其他线程修改了 head</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub fn pop(&#x26;self) -> Option&#x3C;T> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        loop {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            let current_head = self.head.load(Ordering::Acquire);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            if current_head.is_null() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                return None;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            let next = unsafe { (*current_head).next };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            if self.head.compare_exchange_weak(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                current_head,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                next,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                Ordering::AcqRel,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                Ordering::Acquire,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ).is_ok() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                let data = unsafe { Box::from_raw(current_head).data };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                return Some(data);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl&#x3C;T> Drop for LockFreeStack&#x3C;T> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn drop(&#x26;mut self) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        while self.pop().is_some() {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"aba-问题与-epoch-based-回收\">ABA 问题与 epoch-based 回收</h2><p>Treiber Stack 的 pop 操作存在 ABA 问题：线程 A 读取 head→X→Y，被挂起；线程 B pop X、pop Y、push X（X 被重新入栈）；线程 A 恢复后 CAS 成功（head 仍然是 X），但 X.next 已经不是 Y 了。</p>\n<p>解决方案是 epoch-based 内存回收（如 <code>crossbeam-epoch</code> crate）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use crossbeam_epoch::{self as epoch, Atomic, Owned, Shared};&#10;use std::sync::atomic::Ordering;&#10;&#10;pub struct EpochStack&lt;T&gt; {&#10;    head: Atomic&lt;Node&lt;T&gt;&gt;,&#10;}&#10;&#10;impl&lt;T&gt; EpochStack&lt;T&gt; {&#10;    pub fn pop(&amp;self) -&gt; Option&lt;T&gt; {&#10;        let guard = epoch::pin();  // 进入 epoch，保护当前引用的节点&#10;&#10;        loop {&#10;            let head = self.head.load(Ordering::Acquire, &amp;guard);&#10;            let head_ref = unsafe { head.as_ref()? };&#10;            let next = head_ref.next.load(Ordering::Relaxed, &amp;guard);&#10;&#10;            if self.head.compare_exchange(&#10;                head, next, Ordering::AcqRel, Ordering::Acquire, &amp;guard&#10;            ).is_ok() {&#10;                // 延迟释放：等所有线程离开当前 epoch 后才 drop&#10;                unsafe {&#10;                    guard.defer_destroy(head);&#10;                    return Some(ptr::read(&amp;head_ref.data));&#10;                }&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;        // guard Drop 时可能触发回收&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use crossbeam_epoch::{self as epoch, Atomic, Owned, Shared};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use std::sync::atomic::Ordering;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub struct EpochStack&#x3C;T> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    head: Atomic&#x3C;Node&#x3C;T>>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl&#x3C;T> EpochStack&#x3C;T> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub fn pop(&#x26;self) -> Option&#x3C;T> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let guard = epoch::pin();  // 进入 epoch，保护当前引用的节点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        loop {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            let head = self.head.load(Ordering::Acquire, &#x26;guard);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            let head_ref = unsafe { head.as_ref()? };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            let next = head_ref.next.load(Ordering::Relaxed, &#x26;guard);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            if self.head.compare_exchange(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                head, next, Ordering::AcqRel, Ordering::Acquire, &#x26;guard</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ).is_ok() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                // 延迟释放：等所有线程离开当前 epoch 后才 drop</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                unsafe {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    guard.defer_destroy(head);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    return Some(ptr::read(&#x26;head_ref.data));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // guard Drop 时可能触发回收</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"spsc-环形缓冲区\">SPSC 环形缓冲区</h2><p>单生产者单消费者（SPSC）队列是系统编程中最常见的无锁结构——中断处理器（生产者）与主循环（消费者）之间的通信通道。由于只有一个读者和一个写者，不需要 CAS，仅靠 Acquire/Release 语义就能保证正确性。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use std::sync::atomic::{AtomicUsize, Ordering};&#10;use std::cell::UnsafeCell;&#10;use std::mem::MaybeUninit;&#10;&#10;pub struct SpscQueue&lt;T, const N: usize&gt; {&#10;    buffer: UnsafeCell&lt;[MaybeUninit&lt;T&gt;; N]&gt;,&#10;    head: AtomicUsize,  // 消费者读取位置&#10;    tail: AtomicUsize,  // 生产者写入位置&#10;}&#10;&#10;unsafe impl&lt;T: Send, const N: usize&gt; Send for SpscQueue&lt;T, N&gt; {}&#10;unsafe impl&lt;T: Send, const N: usize&gt; Sync for SpscQueue&lt;T, N&gt; {}&#10;&#10;impl&lt;T, const N: usize&gt; SpscQueue&lt;T, N&gt; {&#10;    pub fn push(&amp;self, value: T) -&gt; Result&lt;(), T&gt; {&#10;        let tail = self.tail.load(Ordering::Relaxed);&#10;        let next_tail = (tail + 1) % N;&#10;&#10;        if next_tail == self.head.load(Ordering::Acquire) {&#10;            return Err(value);  // 队列满&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        unsafe {&#10;            (*self.buffer.get())[tail] = MaybeUninit::new(value);&#10;        }&#10;        self.tail.store(next_tail, Ordering::Release);&#10;        Ok(())&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    pub fn pop(&amp;self) -&gt; Option&lt;T&gt; {&#10;        let head = self.head.load(Ordering::Relaxed);&#10;&#10;        if head == self.tail.load(Ordering::Acquire) {&#10;            return None;  // 队列空&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        let value = unsafe {&#10;            (*self.buffer.get())[head].assume_init_read()&#10;        };&#10;        self.head.store((head + 1) % N, Ordering::Release);&#10;        Some(value)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use std::sync::atomic::{AtomicUsize, Ordering};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use std::cell::UnsafeCell;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use std::mem::MaybeUninit;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub struct SpscQueue&#x3C;T, const N: usize> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    buffer: UnsafeCell&#x3C;[MaybeUninit&#x3C;T>; N]>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    head: AtomicUsize,  // 消费者读取位置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    tail: AtomicUsize,  // 生产者写入位置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>unsafe impl&#x3C;T: Send, const N: usize> Send for SpscQueue&#x3C;T, N> {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>unsafe impl&#x3C;T: Send, const N: usize> Sync for SpscQueue&#x3C;T, N> {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl&#x3C;T, const N: usize> SpscQueue&#x3C;T, N> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub fn push(&#x26;self, value: T) -> Result&#x3C;(), T> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let tail = self.tail.load(Ordering::Relaxed);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let next_tail = (tail + 1) % N;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if next_tail == self.head.load(Ordering::Acquire) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            return Err(value);  // 队列满</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        unsafe {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            (*self.buffer.get())[tail] = MaybeUninit::new(value);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        self.tail.store(next_tail, Ordering::Release);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Ok(())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub fn pop(&#x26;self) -> Option&#x3C;T> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let head = self.head.load(Ordering::Relaxed);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if head == self.tail.load(Ordering::Acquire) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            return None;  // 队列空</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let value = unsafe {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            (*self.buffer.get())[head].assume_init_read()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        self.head.store((head + 1) % N, Ordering::Release);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Some(value)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"实践建议与性能陷阱\">实践建议与性能陷阱</h2><p>无锁编程的常见性能陷阱：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>伪共享</strong>：原子变量共享缓存行导致乒乓效应——使用 <code>#[repr(align(64))]</code> 分离</li>\n<li><strong>CAS 风暴</strong>：高竞争下大量线程反复 CAS 失败——考虑指数退避或分段设计</li>\n<li><strong>编译器重排</strong>：<code>Relaxed</code> 不阻止编译器重排无关操作——需要时使用 <code>compiler_fence</code></li>\n<li><strong>过度 SeqCst</strong>：默认使用最强内存序会牺牲性能——逐个操作分析最弱可行序</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>CAS 循环是所有无锁结构的基础模式</li>\n<li>内存序从弱到强选择：Relaxed → Acquire/Release → AcqRel → SeqCst</li>\n<li>ABA 问题通过 epoch-based 回收或 tagged pointer 解决</li>\n<li>SPSC 队列不需要 CAS，仅靠 Acquire/Release 语义</li>\n<li>Rust 类型系统强制 Send/Sync 声明，编译期防止数据竞争</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本章下一篇 <a href=\"ffi-and-c-interop\">FFI 与 C 互操作</a> 覆盖跨语言边界的安全工程</li>\n<li>跨库参考：<a href=\"../../concurrency-models/shared-memory-and-async/threads-and-shared-memory\">并发模型 - 共享内存与线程</a> 从理论角度讲解共享内存并发</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"无锁数据结构实现","id":"无锁数据结构实现"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"无锁栈（Treiber Stack）","id":"无锁栈-treiber-stack"},{"level":2,"text":"ABA 问题与 epoch-based 回收","id":"aba-问题与-epoch-based-回收"},{"level":2,"text":"SPSC 环形缓冲区","id":"spsc-环形缓冲区"},{"level":2,"text":"实践建议与性能陷阱","id":"实践建议与性能陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"硬件抽象层与 embedded-hal 设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-systems-programming/embedded/hardware-abstraction"},"next":{"title":"FFI 与 C 互操作工程实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-systems-programming/practice/ffi-and-c-interop"}}